Synoptic assessment

This unit allows students to gain underpinning knowledge and understanding relevant to the qualification and
sector. The NEA units draw on and strengthen this learning with students applying their learning in a practical,
skills-based way. The synoptic grids at the end of the NEA units show these synoptic links.

More information about synoptic assessment within this qualification can be found in section 5.2 synoptic
